      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe implementation is opt-in, preserves fallback behavior, and has focused coverage matching its precision contract.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds an opt-in Megatron patch that uses BF16 operands for FP32 MoE router backward GEMMs while preserving existing fallback behavior.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds the `moe_router_bwd_bf16` configuration flag.\n- Wraps the router backward implementation with precision-aware BF16 GEMMs.\n- Adds focused numerical, fallback, opt-in, and idempotency tests.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `primus/​configs/​models/​megatron/​language_model.yaml` | Defines the disabled-by-default feature flag. |\r\n| `primus/​backends/​megatron/​patches/​moe_patches/​router_bwd_bf16_patches.py` | Implements and registers the backward GEMM patch. |\r\n| `tests/​unit_tests/​backends/​megatron/​test_router_bwd_bf16_patches.py` | Verifies precision, dispatch, fallback, and installation behavior. |\n</details>\n\n🧠 **Review effort:** Balanced\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/AMD-AGI/Primus/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
